        <dc:title>BUILDING A SELF-SERVICE LEARNING PLATFORM USING CLOUD NATIVE TOOLS AND GITOPS</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>Providing hands-on laboratory exercises for developers is an effective way to build competence with new tools and methodologies. While many commercial and open source platforms offer learning paths for users, they often come at a cost and offer limited customization. Additionally, emerging methodologies such as chaos engineering often lack guided learning tracks altogether.</dcterms:abstract>
