            </dcterms:URI>
        </dc:identifier>
        <dcterms:dateSubmitted>2026-01-06 00:41:48</dcterms:dateSubmitted>
    </rdf:Description>
    <bib:Memo rdf:about="#item_178">
        <rdf:value>[TLDR] ViperProbe is the first scalable eBPF-based dynamic and adaptive microservices metrics collection framework that provides dynamic sampling and collection of deep, diverse, and precise system metrics, and is described as the CriticalMetrics.</rdf:value>
